const concepts=[
 ['One real agent loop','Nitro calls the TypeScript Claude Agent SDK query() function and consumes the async iterator. The native CLI owns model transport and returns actual final metrics.'],
 ['Nuxt on both sides','Vue Composition API manages the learning lab. Nuxt renders the initial page and hydrates it in the browser; Nitro owns server routes in the same project.'],
 ['State that stays with you','The lab stays mounted while lesson sections change, preserving your prompt, mode, result and timeline. A synchronous running flag blocks duplicate submissions.'],
 ['Private configuration','The model key stays in the server environment. Nuxt dev loads .env; the production launcher explicitly loads it for local use. No private key belongs in NUXT_PUBLIC_ variables.'],
 ['A packaged Node runtime','The Nitro node-server output includes the SDK JavaScript and native platform executable. Build on the target operating system; Linux deployments use a glibc-compatible Node environment.'],
